..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[33].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"屆試題-1.108會考國文科第31題：","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[34].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「少了《史記》，這個歷史會少掉多少故事？會少掉多少可歌可泣的人物？而那在韓信落魄時給他一碗飯吃的漂母，使我不敢小看在河邊漂洗衣服的無名女人。那和屈原對話的漁父，也使我相信捕魚人中有大智若愚的隱者。《史記》書寫了主流價值之外的另一種信仰。」根據這段文字，下列何者最符合作者對《史記》 的看法？","n":145,"ssz":".........1.............................1...2...........................1......1....1.............................2..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[34].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(A)呈現市井小民在歷史上的意義","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[34].paragraphs[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(B)描寫史事詳盡，考證鉅細靡遺","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[34].paragraphs[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(C)透過平凡人物襯托主角的不凡","n":16,"ssz":"............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[34].paragraphs[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(D)顛覆大智若愚的傳統主流價值","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[36].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.根據這段文字，下列何者最符合作者對《史記》 的看法？","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[36].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"呈現市井小民在歷史上的意義","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[36].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"描寫史事詳盡，考證鉅細靡遺","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[36].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"透過平凡人物襯托主角的不凡","n":13,"ssz":".........1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[36].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"顛覆大智若愚的傳統主流價值","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[37].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.根據題幹，題目要找的是作者對【　】的看法","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[37].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"史記","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[38].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷比選項：\n🄐呈現市井小民在歷史上的意義→《史記》寫平凡百姓，讓小人物被看見\n🄑描寫史事詳盡，考證鉅細靡遺→《史記》記載非常詳盡，經過完整考證\n🄒透過平凡人物襯托主角的不凡→《史記》的平凡人物只是用來襯托主角\n🄓顛覆大智若愚的傳統主流價值→《史記》故意推翻傳統價值","n":136,"ssz":".....................................................................................1....................1............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[38].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷比選項：","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[38].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"🄐呈現市井小民在歷史上的意義→《史記》寫平凡百姓，讓小人物被看見","n":33,"ssz":"................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[38].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"🄑描寫史事詳盡，考證鉅細靡遺→《史記》記載非常詳盡，經過完整考證","n":33,"ssz":"................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[38].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"🄒透過平凡人物襯托主角的不凡→《史記》的平凡人物只是用來襯托主角","n":33,"ssz":"...........1....................1"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[38].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"🄓顛覆大智若愚的傳統主流價值→《史記》故意推翻傳統價值","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[40].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.開頭句點出史記有什麼特色？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[40].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"留下了許多故事與人物事蹟","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[40].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀了會讓人悲傷不已","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[41].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.結尾句點出史記有什麼特色？","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[41].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只記錄名人和大官的故事","n":11,"ssz":".....1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[41].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不只記錄名人大官的故事","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[44].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.開頭句強調《史記》留下許多歷史故事，結尾句則強調《史記》呈現了非主流的價值。\n2.選項【　】和【　】都強調《史記》留下的記錄，但文中沒有提及是否詳盡、完整，因此【　】可刪除。\n3.且選項【　】的「市井小民」就是用來呈現主流價值之外的例子。\n4.綜合線索，答案為：【　】","n":136,"ssz":"......1..................1......................1.....1................................................................1................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[44].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.開頭句強調《史記》留下許多歷史故事，結尾句則強調《史記》呈現了非主流的價值。","n":40,"ssz":"......1..................1.............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[44].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.選項【　】和【　】都強調《史記》留下的記錄，但文中沒有提及是否詳盡、完整，因此【　】可刪除。","n":48,"ssz":".......1.....1.................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[44].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.且選項【　】的「市井小民」就是用來呈現主流價值之外的例子。","n":31,"ssz":".............................1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[44].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.綜合線索，答案為：【　】","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[45].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據這段文字，下列何者最符合作者對《史記》 的看法？","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[45].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"題目與選項在 ❺ 第 4 步後**再印一次**（供對照），原稿如此。","n":34,"ssz":".................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[46].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→若再回頭核對細節，也會發現文中所舉的漂母、漁父，就是市井小民的代表。","n":35,"ssz":".......................1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[48].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"來試試更長的文章吧！文章總共三段，我們練習只看頭尾兩段。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[49].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"挑戰題2：用策略試試會考題。\n（109會考國文科第40題）","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[49].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"挑戰題2：用策略試試會考題。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[49].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"（109會考國文科第40題）","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[50].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(一)所謂的「歷史」，是「過去人類的所有活動」；而所謂的「歷史學」， 是「從史料（包括文獻、考古）所能復原過去人類的所有活動」。從各種史料中，不斷進行研究和比較，逐步接近真實，這就是歷史學的本色，也是歷史學家所從事的工作。因為這世上從來無法得到「真實的歷史」，我們所能得到的只有「歷史的真實」。","n":147,"ssz":".......................................................................1.....1..................................1.................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[50].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學習單只印頭段（一）；全文三段以圖片形式附在右側，見 source_images。","n":41,"ssz":"........................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[52].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.本文的觀點與下列何者最接近？","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[52].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「歷史」的研究是為了追求「歷史的真實」→強調歷史的真實","n":27,"ssz":"........1............1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[52].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「歷史學」不斷進步可得到「真實的歷史」→強調真實的歷史","n":27,"ssz":".....1...............1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[52].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"史書記載絕對可信，不容後人缺乏實據的懷疑→強調史書絕對可信","n":29,"ssz":"......................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[52].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為了增加史書的可讀性，作者多半會虛構情節→強調史書多半虛構","n":29,"ssz":"1.....................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[53].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.根據題幹，要問的是本文的【　】。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[53].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"觀點","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[54].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷比選項\n(A)「歷史」的研究是為了追求「歷史的真實」→強調歷史的真實\n(B)「歷史學」不斷進步可得到「真實的歷史」→強調真實的歷史\n(C)史書記載絕對可信，不容後人缺乏實據的懷疑→強調史書絕對可信\n(D)為了增加史書的可讀性，作者多半會虛構情節→強調史書多半虛構","n":132,"ssz":"................1............1..............1...............1...............................1..........1.....................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[54].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(A)「歷史」的研究是為了追求「歷史的真實」→強調歷史的真實","n":30,"ssz":"...........1............1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[54].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(B)「歷史學」不斷進步可得到「真實的歷史」→強調真實的歷史","n":30,"ssz":"........1...............1....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[54].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(C)史書記載絕對可信，不容後人缺乏實據的懷疑→強調史書絕對可信","n":32,"ssz":".........................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[54].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(D)為了增加史書的可讀性，作者多半會虛構情節→強調史書多半虛構","n":32,"ssz":"...1.....................1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[55].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❸讀頭尾句：本文有三段，除了頭尾段之外，每段的頭尾句也是重點。","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[56].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"頭段（一）在 ❸ 再印一次（灰底方塊），供對照頭尾句用。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[57].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→看文章開頭段（一）的開頭和結尾：","n":17,"ssz":".............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[58].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.開頭段的開頭句認為「歷史」和「歷史學」：","n":22,"ssz":"...............1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[58].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"相同","n":2,"ssz":"1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[58].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不同","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[59].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.開頭段的結尾句認為：","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[59].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沒有真實的歷史，只有歷史的真實","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[59].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沒有歷史的真實，只有真實的歷史","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[60].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(三)歷史學講究「持之有故，言之成理」，從許多《史記》的內容來看，太史公所記都有其根據。有些他根據的史料，今日還能見到，可以驗證這一點。只是太史公時代的書籍，已經有太多亡佚，因此有更多的記事，今天已經無法得知出處為何。我從不認為《史記》上的記載「絕對」可信，但若你不相信古人所記的史事，請拿出更可靠的證據。唯有如此，歷史學才能不斷進步，不致流於虛無的懷疑。","n":178,"ssz":".................................................................2.......................................11....1.....................1.............................1....1........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[60].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學習單只印尾段（三），中間的（二）段不印 —— 對應標題那句「我們練習只看頭尾兩段」。","n":43,"ssz":"..................1......1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[61].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"→看文章結尾段（三）的開頭和結尾：","n":17,"ssz":".............1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[62].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.結尾段的開頭句強調史記的記載：","n":17,"ssz":"..........1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[62].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"大多有根據","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[62].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"大多缺乏根據","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[63].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.結尾段的結尾句表示史記的記載：","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[63].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"絕對可信","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[63].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"並非絕對可信","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[64].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.結尾段的結尾句認為，要讓歷史學進步，必須：","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[64].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對事情抱持懷疑","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[64].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"拿出更可靠的證據。","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[65].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❹找結論詞：「因此」有更多的記事，今天已經無法得知出處為何。→可連結後句「我從不認為《史記》上的記載「絕對」可信」","n":57,"ssz":"..........................11...........1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[66].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❺綜合線索：選出最符合的答案：\n1.第一段結尾強調沒有真實的歷史：選項【　】可刪除。\n2.第三段結尾強調史記並非絕對可信：選項【　】可刪除。\n3.第三段開頭強調史記的記載大多都有根據：選項【　】可刪除。\n4.第一段結尾強調要追求「歷史的真實」，故正確答案為選項【　】。","n":134,"ssz":"........................1..........................1...........................1..............................1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[66].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❺綜合線索：選出最符合的答案：","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[66].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.第一段結尾強調沒有真實的歷史：選項【　】可刪除。","n":26,"ssz":"........1................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[66].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.第三段結尾強調史記並非絕對可信：選項【　】可刪除。","n":27,"ssz":"........1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[66].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.第三段開頭強調史記的記載大多都有根據：選項【　】可刪除。","n":30,"ssz":"........1....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[66].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.第一段結尾強調要追求「歷史的真實」，故正確答案為選項【　】。","n":32,"ssz":"........1......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[67].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"挑戰題3：再試試看一篇！","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[68].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"歷屆試題-３.110會考國文科第38題：","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[69].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(一)東非草原上，鐮莢金合歡樹提供原生舉尾蟻花蜜與住所，而舉尾蟻會保護金合歡免受食草性動物侵害，並攻擊啃食金合歡的非洲象。21世紀初，外來的熱帶大頭家蟻突然出現在肯亞，牠們會殺死舉尾蟻並吃掉其幼體，讓非洲象得以肆無忌憚地啃食金合歡。","n":116,"ssz":"...................................................................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[69].paragraphs[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(五)針對這樣的結果，專家認為：這些入侵的螞蟻可能早就出現，但沒有人注意。我們現在發現牠們以非常微妙的方式改變了生態景觀。","n":61,"ssz":"............................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[69].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"學習單只印頭段（一）與尾段（五），中間三段不印；全文五段以圖片形式附在右側，見 source_images。","n":54,"ssz":".....................1................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[71].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.依據本文引述的研究發現，無法說明下列何者？","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[71].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"設置保護區有助於維護自然原始生態","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[71].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"外來物種可能會對本地生態造成衝擊","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[71].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"面對環境的變遷，生命自會找到出路","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[71].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"破壞生物間的互利關係恐有連鎖反應","n":16,"ssz":"...............1"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[72].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.根據題幹，要問的是本文：","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[72].options.1","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有提及的事","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[72].options.2","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"沒有提及的事","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[73].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❷比選項：\n(A)設置保護區有助於維護自然原始生態→保護區能維護原始生態\n(B)外來物種可能會對本地生態造成衝擊→外來物種會衝擊本地生態\n(C)面對環境的變遷，生命自會找到出路→生物會調整方式以適應變化\n(D)破壞生物間的互利關係恐有連鎖反應→生物關係被破壞會引發連鎖影響","n":136,"ssz":"..................................................................................................1.....................1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[73].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(A)設置保護區有助於維護自然原始生態→保護區能維護原始生態","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[73].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(B)外來物種可能會對本地生態造成衝擊→外來物種會衝擊本地生態","n":31,"ssz":"..............................."},{"se